# Task tracking

## Plan for fixing errors + running code
1. Run Django system checks + migrations, find current failing errors.
2. Run tests (if any) and fix template/static issues.
3. Fix compile/runtime errors found by `python manage.py check`, `migrate`, and `runserver`/smoke tests.
4. Ensure checkout/order flow works (cart add/update/checkout/order_success/order_lookup).
5. Re-run `python -m compileall`, `python manage.py check` after changes.


